  "bio": "Luke Puzkar is a masterful tattoo artist based in Aachen, Germany, best known for their exquisite floral, black & gray, and dotwork styles. Clients consistently praise Luke's professionalism throughout the tattooing process, ensuring each piece meets the highest standards of artistry and execution. If you're in Aachen and seeking a tattoo that requires meticulous attention to detail, reach out to Luke Puzkar for an experience that is as professional as it is transformative.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Aachen, North-rhine-westphalia, Germany\n\nT A T T O O S  M I T  S E E L E • A A C H E N\n🗓️ Termine April/Mai 2026\n📩 𝘐𝘕𝘍𝘖@𝘓𝘜𝘒𝘌𝘛𝘏𝘌𝘔𝘖𝘕𝘒𝘌𝘠.𝘊𝘖𝘔\n🏛️ @the.backyard.gallery\n🥋 @official.fuenfzweinull",
